  "description": "Listed building consent for&nbsp;Works to improve the levels of thermal comfort within the\r\noccupied areas of William Morris Gallery - Basement: Installation of\r\nreplacement extraction fan, exhaust ducting, new attenuator and distribution\r\nboard. Ground and first floors: Installation of extract fans within the fireplaces\r\ninvolving refurbishment and restoration of the fireplace surrounds, installation\r\nof an extract grille above doorway and alterations to the floorboards to create\r\naccess points for maintenance of the MEP (Mechanical, Electrical and Plumbing)\r\npipework. Second floor: Installation of high-level air-conditioning units and diffuser\r\nvents. Roof: Improvement of the existing insulation within the internal roof\r\nvoid and installation of condenser units and ASHP (Air Source Heat Pumps).\r\nWorks include the application of solar control film to all windows.",
